<title>CANADA: Mainframe in buyback of Alliance stake.</title>
<headline>Mainframe in buyback of Alliance stake.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Communications Corp said on Wednesday that Mainframe Entertainment Inc had repurchased a part of Alliance's shares in Mainframe for $8.55 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Alliance continued to hold 15 percent of the issued and outstanding shares of Mainframe, a computer animation company.</p>
<p>Alliance will maintain board representation. In a deal completed in July, Alliance received $7.5 million from Mainframe, recouping most of its investment in the development of the company.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
